    "body": "I agree, but that module is pretty hairy.  It got converted to strings very early in the module\r\n\r\nI tried to refactor it to always use &Path or &PathBuf, but it ended up a complete rewrite (due to the current version making it a string quite early on), so instead I went with a patch that changed as little as possible.",
